      "stdout": "Read a compact draft overview for locating segment ids.\r\n\r\nAGENT QUICKSTART (driving this as an agent? start here):\r\n  Browse commands:  lyra-cli <domain> --help\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n  lyra-cli <domain> <[subdomain] ...> <action> [--flags] [--options]\r\n\r\n\r\nOPTIONS:\r\n  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit\r\n          --ref TEXT          Unified draft reference to inspect\r\n          --dir TEXT          Optional parent directory for resolving the draft project folder.\r\n          --seg-id TEXT       Optional raw segment id to inspect\r\n          --protocol <stdraft> \r\n                              Read protocol. Only stdraft is currently supported; default\r\n                              stdraft\r\n\r\nREAD-ONLY\r\n  This is the explicit shortcut for `scope=summary`.\r\n  Use --seg-id for one raw segment id; do not pass selector expressions.\r\n\r\nEXAMPLES\r\n  # Inspect the focused draft\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft extract summary\r\n  # Inspect a named draft\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft extract summary --ref local://example\r\n  # Inspect one segment by raw id\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft extract summary --ref local://example --seg-id <UUID>\r\n",
